    <briefdescription>
<para>Token bucket rate limiter. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tokens refill at <computeroutput>rate_bps</computeroutput> bits per second up to a maximum of <computeroutput>burst_bytes</computeroutput> bytes. A call to <computeroutput>consume(bytes)</computeroutput> returns immediately if enough tokens are available, otherwise it blocks or (optionally) returns false.</para>
<para>Thread-safe via an internal mutex.</para>
<para>Algorithm: tokens += elapsed_seconds * rate_bps / 8 (byte-level refill) tokens = min(tokens, burst_bytes) </para>
    </detaileddescription>
